{"中文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b4/a0irb5b1bxb44a3zolaqyi4z2beq0hq.mp3","text":"博士的房间还是挺整洁的嘛，还不赖。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:8/80/dfncil7ik3fzv3icyovy6fd5zj0kqa0.mp3","text":"水是大家生活的核心，我已经跟可露希尔小姐交流过改善罗德岛净水系统的事情了，希望我的研究成果能给帮上忙......这样我也不用担心用水不干净了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/5562cw9hfhcx7n2iap9xawiviepnm2n.mp3","text":"这只仿生海龙小叶是我以家族流传的图案为原型制作出来的，除了辅助作战，在日常生活中也可以帮我不少忙，比如倒个水拎些重物之类的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/38/otkv6hlwoakmtyuj4pnuc9hxs8ua3iy.mp3","text":"和格劳克斯约好的自动化工程实验时间差不多快到了，博士有兴趣一起去看看吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/2ukb3i1zqkvsa1z0p8bv0bpif3kitz1.mp3","text":"这些蓄水炮本来都是为了工程才制造的，除了高压水以外，还可以释放出高温蒸汽束。所以请不要随便触碰，他们可不是可露希尔的小车。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:5/59/3qejfyzxmuo9sw652qah7flsv8se8ix.mp3","text":"这些高阶的作战资料是我自己根据作战情况总结的。为了之后的战斗，就麻烦博士仔细阅读一下。然后之后还有好几个我想完善的作战实验也麻烦博士帮我一起，博士肯定不会拒绝我的吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:2/23/p4wc4bqku8351sskpa6n5zbuyjcecyw.mp3","text":"平时我也偶尔会去一趟调香师小姐的庭院休息休息。那里的气味就能让人彻底放松下来，对于缓解研究的疲劳实在是再有效不过了，下次博士要一起去试试吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:4/43/hy00j1xrct3q7gpd5p2c9jduqtranhy.mp3","text":"我才不会一个人的时候跟仿生海龙聊天！给他起名字是为了做区分！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c1/rf3tsobajm98dc64a8n4k4igo3zylvw.mp3","text":"受了不少博士的关照，最近我也越来越习惯待在有博士在的环境里了。除了格劳克斯和研究的同事，明明还挺少见的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d8/6723ot4utk90pjtxwsjk88tu77utg8c.mp3","text":"安静的环境真好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/48/4jzxvdiiehhimqw1yyrbja82ugjywja.mp3","text":"你好，我是罗德岛工程部的温蒂，很早以前就听说过博士的大名了，希望之后能多多指教。啊，握手的话请用这边带着手套的右手。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:1/17/n22vu5gg290f9sgq46b0vykce35gzf0.mp3","text":"嗯，没想到这些还挺有帮助的。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:3/36/aw7rvxg38r0r7962yedu62luf5mv63z.mp3","text":"晋升之后，我的个人房间可以再升级一次吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/65/2fvma38izeqzth3lyo5px3p2krwaxv3.mp3","text":"感谢博士愿意给体弱的我这样的肯定。之后也让我为了罗德岛继续努力吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3c/l79jt921mm0hn6c0znvddndzgdgn5z5.mp3","text":"我也要一起吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/lttmnuz71s3rvnm5j1406cdhoyzhn56.mp3","text":"大家听我指挥！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b0/6tp48y6zss23zn2k8rs6g75ovzohxn9.mp3","text":"出击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:1/14/herw4bmsjns2aafho0pwfcci9xx0bgp.mp3","text":"一切都跟战前预想的一样，开始作战！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:7/72/ftup2tgurhcmvhsvnfftovrzhbve58i.mp3","text":"我在这里。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:b/b8/50xvqyxsyxum0nkik6832y4jav87tyg.mp3","text":"器械准备完备。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/gumm9tttu98c3srfnvp3bu99fc1tc6n.mp3","text":"交给我吧！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_023.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:e/e0/suk5l9k7u5b9aws9ka29a1qucf0ycdb.mp3","text":"小叶，我们加油！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_024.mp3"}],"技能":[{"url":"bwiki:d/dd/78cf11c8ktgeo3kftxl0wek6szh7mh6.mp3","text":"发射！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_025.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:d/d3/ah1mxguyiqbq9w1c799azhnnpkt95ns.mp3","text":"锁定敌人！攻击！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_026.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:f/fd/7du9lcnythw76ar08jwiaonh8c06qj0.mp3","text":"全都让开！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_027.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/eiy3ghpukjqge9mm3wghwlrcoe97yu2.mp3","text":"哈！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_028.mp3"}],"高难胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:f/fc/hoxlyq6e2mug8dxvuvr1uj9g9q70o6y.mp3","text":"只要战术正确了，根本就是小菜一碟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_029.mp3"}],"3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:3/3a/3dyc50rzzf8rqyda3svmdcnodqfp9ot.mp3","text":"工程学的作用不可小觑！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_030.mp3"}],"非3星胜利":[{"url":"bwiki:5/5e/du4gl4fdaoj9tb57ekrff2xq3c49b96.mp3","text":"......等我回去调整一下设备的参数，不会有下次了。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:5/53/hudf6ar0ppnsfq3c6ccoqqokqhbv6pl.mp3","text":"小叶， 掩护我们离开这里！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9b/9xoqmd46ezwffzzy5escaar6brmnn3x.mp3","text":"这里有打扫过吗？","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:a/a2/034adqc1o9zrmk1mvvlc70czk61qc4k.mp3","text":"等，等一下！","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:e/ea/4ztbhom25iw5v75jtg6c86syaiemsiq.mp3","text":"博士，让我也来帮忙做点什么吧。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/s84n8y967wtx60ern7uv5ud0vpk7f0k.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:1/1f/r6ujtvl0060i1ht8z2ure97e1cr1ipu.mp3","text":"博士，站住不许动，让我检查一下。嗯，衣摆没有沾灰，鞋带也是干净的，还不错嘛。等等，衬衫的领子怎么这么皱，难道你打算就这样出席晚会吗？快回去整理一下，我在这等你。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:6/68/8v6d8agzdmbhfe3g7wase5y8pbuug7z.mp3","text":"博士，你好。","alt":"voice_cn/char_400_weedy/cn_042.mp3"}]},"日文":{"登录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/f5/ntmo9h6d50szyon4m2f2onst6mf3t9g.mp3","text":"博士的房间还是挺整洁的嘛，还不赖。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_001.mp3"}],"交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:0/09/tgqynr13hvr0iawl2i4sd4pzv3skylv.mp3","text":"水是大家生活的核心，我已经跟可露希尔小姐交流过改善罗德岛净水系统的事情了，希望我的研究成果能给帮上忙......这样我也不用担心用水不干净了。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_002.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:8/89/3gm94u00fzee7zsqivx721j5ygagb3l.mp3","text":"这只仿生海龙小叶是我以家族流传的图案为原型制作出来的，除了辅助作战，在日常生活中也可以帮我不少忙，比如倒个水拎些重物之类的。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_003.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:1/18/hhh3ishrneitu3ddl8njwtxa2mgzrk9.mp3","text":"和格劳克斯约好的自动化工程实验时间差不多快到了，博士有兴趣一起去看看吗？","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_004.mp3"}],"晋升交谈":[{"url":"bwiki:3/33/tje565zd3ik3fb84unmurp452kv0zr2.mp3","text":"这些蓄水炮本来都是为了工程才制造的，除了高压水以外，还可以释放出高温蒸汽束。所以请不要随便触碰，他们可不是可露希尔的小车。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_005.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:0/00/awxcbjp2sdfzh1s1071ywbbyof4sft0.mp3","text":"这些高阶的作战资料是我自己根据作战情况总结的。为了之后的战斗，就麻烦博士仔细阅读一下。然后之后还有好几个我想完善的作战实验也麻烦博士帮我一起，博士肯定不会拒绝我的吧。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_006.mp3"}],"信赖":[{"url":"bwiki:1/10/903ru1wreu7j6fydcjwqilgebxf03ty.mp3","text":"平时我也偶尔会去一趟调香师小姐的庭院休息休息。那里的气味就能让人彻底放松下来，对于缓解研究的疲劳实在是再有效不过了，下次博士要一起去试试吗？","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_007.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:c/c7/3l7sq8kzbiqdkk9ckkakmj2bi5gcupa.mp3","text":"我才不会一个人的时候跟仿生海龙聊天！给他起名字是为了做区分！","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_008.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:6/63/ru84239t4zn7fv12zlqat9spakwqgeh.mp3","text":"受了不少博士的关照，最近我也越来越习惯待在有博士在的环境里了。除了格劳克斯和研究的同事，明明还挺少见的。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_009.mp3"}],"闲置":[{"url":"bwiki:1/15/o5v04sx8rrykkpx58lnr6hbc0i462b3.mp3","text":"安静的环境真好。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_010.mp3"}],"报到":[{"url":"bwiki:4/4d/4jwe8n32rro183wzmql607po2v3whj0.mp3","text":"你好，我是罗德岛工程部的温蒂，很早以前就听说过博士的大名了，希望之后能多多指教。啊，握手的话请用这边带着手套的右手。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_011.mp3"}],"作战记录":[{"url":"bwiki:f/ff/t3sd4yc35ezvjku31sm5c0z5bmeemp8.mp3","text":"嗯，没想到这些还挺有帮助的。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_012.mp3"}],"精英化1":[{"url":"bwiki:1/16/6v0pmhk8tighqe6radh8g3zf04xm981.mp3","text":"晋升之后，我的个人房间可以再升级一次吗？","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_013.mp3"}],"精英化2":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/r0luzyv19lxe9v8auzq65gbjyn4kp0z.mp3","text":"感谢博士愿意给体弱的我这样的肯定。之后也让我为了罗德岛继续努力吧。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_014.mp3"}],"编入":[{"url":"bwiki:6/67/mtkm27ivcj3klnsvp69oquuchy04vc5.mp3","text":"我也要一起吗？","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_017.mp3"}],"任命队长":[{"url":"bwiki:a/ad/at4ru6jgqr7ebz30lvvtv949jkmyqk3.mp3","text":"大家听我指挥！","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_018.mp3"}],"行动出发":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2e/2j6irg5wy78behjywjc3dryps60vtki.mp3","text":"出击！","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_019.mp3"}],"行动开始":[{"url":"bwiki:2/2f/3mmf4jxdw66gpqmvgfbs8zssx8onyk2.mp3","text":"一切都跟战前预想的一样，开始作战！","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_020.mp3"}],"选中":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b7/a1eg980ar1bpviil0wggwwiai3qrgsk.mp3","text":"我在这里。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_021.mp3"},{"url":"bwiki:3/33/6gta8uf17xc6ni0htathybfudn1i89q.mp3","text":"器械准备完备。","alt":"voice/char_400_weedy/cn_022.mp3"}],"部署":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9d/mx